                "r4": {
                    "type": "review",
                    "settings": {
                        "rating": 5,
                        "quote": "I recently bought a few pieces from Zeha Jewelry and I am really happy with my experience of shopping with them. The look and feel of the jewelry is quite excellent to be honest. The gold plating on the jewelry gives each piece a beautiful shine and looks very elegant. I’ve worn the jewelry multiple times and it still looks as good as it did on day 1. To top it all off the packaging is so thoughtful! Makes for really cute gifts as well. I would definitely recommend Zeha Jewelry for your next jewelry purchase!",
